path every matmul-shaped op flows through), Conv codegen's four-way
branch order with the depthwise condition, and the Scan -> OptScan
per-iteration sequence (set_inputs -> resolve_symbols ->
exec_plan -> outputs -> reset_turn) with the load-bearing
'reset_turn clears resolved_symbols' caveat.
